  <description>
    <p>Arithmetic bit shift left/right by ShiftNumber (signed 64-bit).</p>
    <table border="1">
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Module</td><td><code>nflow_blocks</code></td></tr>
        <tr><td>Library</td><td>Logic / Bit Operations</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Type</td><td><code>shiftArithmetic</code></td></tr>
        <tr><td>Label</td><td>Shift Arithmetic</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p><img src="../../../../libraries/logic/exports/shiftArithmetic.svg" align="middle"/></p>
    <p><b>Description</b></p>
    <p>Arithmetic bit shift of the integer-valued input. <code>ShiftDirection</code> = "Left" multiplies by 2^ShiftNumber; "Right" performs a sign-preserving arithmetic right shift (dividing by 2^ShiftNumber, rounding toward negative infinity). Values are treated as signed 64-bit integers; the left shift is computed through unsigned arithmetic to stay well-defined. Element-wise over the input width.</p>
    <p><b>Ports</b></p>
    <p><b>Input(s)</b></p>
    <table border="1">
      <thead><tr><th>Port</th><th>Role</th><th>Side</th><th>Position</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Port_1</td><td>Numeric signal read by the block.</td><td>left</td><td>x=0, y=40</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p><b>Output(s)</b></p>
    <table border="1">
      <thead><tr><th>Port</th><th>Role</th><th>Side</th><th>Position</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Port_1</td><td>Numeric signal produced by the block.</td><td>right</td><td>x=90, y=40</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p><b>Parameters</b></p>
    <table border="1">
      <thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Default value</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>ShiftDirection</code></td><td>Left</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>ShiftNumber</code></td><td>1</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p><b>Block Characteristics</b></p>
    <table border="1">
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Block type</td><td>shiftArithmetic</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Family</td><td>Logic / Bit Operations</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Rendered size</td><td>90 x 80</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Phases</td><td>ALGEBRAIC</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Internal state or history</td><td>no</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Signal data type</td><td>double numeric values</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p><b>Algorithms</b></p>
    <ul>
      <li>ALGEBRAIC: Left -&gt; out = x &lt;&lt; ShiftNumber; Right -&gt; out = x &gt;&gt; ShiftNumber (arithmetic).</li>
    </ul>
    <p><b>Equation or Rule</b></p>
    <latex>y = u \cdot 2^{\pm \text{ShiftNumber}}</latex>
    <p><b>Extended Capabilities</b></p>
    <p>Code generation: supported for C and Rust.</p>
